    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d770">

                <pb facs="0898" n="802" xml:id="pg802"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">361.11/3798: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Young</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-20T10:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 20,
                                1921—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 6:33
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>491. The granting full facilities to Americans to leave Russia incorporated in
                    the agreement to be signed this morning.<anchor n="11" xml:id="d770-f1"/>
                    Keeley, whose arrival expected shortly, should be able give us accurate
                    information regarding Bolshevik real attitude in matter Americans still in
                    Russia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d770-f1" n="11" xml:id="d770-f1-content">
                <p>For text of agreement signed Aug. 20, see <ref target="#pg813">p. 813</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
